&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 2;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 2;"&gt;&lt;a name="Section4"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;WISCONSIN RIVER POWER COMPANY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;NOTES TO REGULATORY BASIS FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;AS OF AND FOR THE YEARS ENDED December&amp;#160;31, 2025 AND 2024 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The following Notes 1-6 are included in our Form 1 in accordance with the reporting requirements of the FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;NOTE 1--SUMMARY OF SIGNIFICANT ACCOUNTING POLICIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection5"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 3;"&gt;&lt;a name="Section5"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;(a) Nature of Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;WPS, an indirect, wholly owned subsidiary of WEC Energy Group, and WPL, a wholly owned subsidiary of Alliant Energy Corporation, are equal 50% owners of us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;We own and operate hydroelectric power generation facilities with a combined rated capacity of 35 megawatts at two dam sites on the Wisconsin River. We primarily operate as a producer of hydroelectric power for our two owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection6"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 3;"&gt;&lt;a name="Section6"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;(b) Use of Estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;We prepare our financial statements in conformity with the rules and regulations of the FERC. Management makes estimates and assumptions that affect the reported amounts of assets and liabilities, the disclosure of contingent assets and liabilities at the date of the financial statements, and the reported amounts of revenues and expenses during the reporting period. Actual results may differ from these estimates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="WordSection7"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-outline-level: 3;"&gt;&lt;a name="Section7"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;(c) Cash and Temporary Cash Investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Cash and temporary cash investments include short-term investments with an original maturity of three months or less.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 5.0pt; line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Significant non-cash investing transactions include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" width="720" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 12.0pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 372.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 12.0pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="496"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Times_New_Roman, serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 3.75pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 12.0pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;" valign="bottom" width="5"&gt;
