&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 2.75pt 0in 1.5pt 0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;Accounts payable related to construction costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
