&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 13.5pt; text-indent: -13.5pt; line-height: 120%; tab-stops: 13.0pt;"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;(1)&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Primarily represents the unrecognized future pension and OPEB benefits related to our defined benefit pension and OPEB plans. We will amortize these regulatory liabilities into net periodic benefit cost over the average remaining service life of each plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
