&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;In 2025, we had an actuarial loss related to our pension benefit obligations of $5,059 and actuarial gain in 2024 of $135,142. The primary driver for the actuarial loss in 2025 was the decrease in discount rate. The primary driver for the actuarial gain in 2024 was a higher discount rate. Partially offsetting the gain in 2024, was lower than expected asset returns. The discount rate for our pension benefits was 5.60%, 5.70%, and 5.15%, in 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;In 2025 and 2024, we had actuarial losses related to our OPEB benefit obligations of $31,212 and $11,071, respectively, both of which were driven by changes to medical trend assumptions and claims and premium updates. Partially offsetting the loss in 2024 was a higher discount rate. The discount rate for our OPEB benefits was 5.75% in both 2025 and 2024, and 5.15% in 2023, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 5.0pt; line-height: 120%;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The amounts recognized on our balance sheets at December 31 related to the funded status of the benefit plans were as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
