&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; mso-pagination: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Savings Plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 120%; page-break-after: avoid;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"&gt;WEC Energy Group sponsors 401(k) savings plans that allow substantially all of our full-time employees to contribute a portion of their pre&amp;#8208;tax and/or after&amp;#8208;tax income in accordance with plan&amp;#8208;specified guidelines. A percentage of employee contributions are matched by us through a contribution into the employee's savings plan account, up to certain limits. The 401(k) savings plans include an Employee Stock Ownership Plan. Certain employees receive a retirement contribution in lieu of receiving a pension benefit. Total costs incurred under these plans were $63,454 in 2025 and $51,313 in 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
