        <p>
          <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">Account 456 includes revenue from timber sales and dock slip payments.</span>
          <br />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHA50F81BAAA7410325E77B8E745C434EB" xlink:to="HH307F394EE3CB3E7761504F5F83E40F7C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH8532E9DF24050C8D5FCA8B6B22F59B3B" xlink:label="HH8532E9DF24050C8D5FCA8B6B22F59B3B" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7A42C327FF6D66992E27DA58F6FFDF67" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Includes netting of accounts receivable and accounts payable based on affiliate and generation contracts.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH8532E9DF24050C8D5FCA8B6B22F59B3B" xlink:to="HH7A42C327FF6D66992E27DA58F6FFDF67" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHA8F956D1519B594D53574B832349A8FC" xlink:label="HHA8F956D1519B594D53574B832349A8FC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD581CA1427735DDAC2D38FC756B6B106" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Includes netting of accounts receivable and accounts payable based on affiliate and generation contracts.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHA8F956D1519B594D53574B832349A8FC" xlink:to="HHD581CA1427735DDAC2D38FC756B6B106" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH43A16C7D4DD63A8AEC9B1765BA2B8D17" xlink:label="HH43A16C7D4DD63A8AEC9B1765BA2B8D17" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH0D2DDE0EF506820C94558429623FDFCF" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The total transfers for the year include plant account transfers related to the implementation of FERC Order 898 as well as normal transfers between plant accounts.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH43A16C7D4DD63A8AEC9B1765BA2B8D17" xlink:to="HH0D2DDE0EF506820C94558429623FDFCF" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9CCC2F323B8E2676A123B1485A37C118" xlink:label="HH9CCC2F323B8E2676A123B1485A37C118" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHB24F9A2F0998B0C81F55990DEDAE9A10" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Software reserve reclassification (Account 111 to 108) per FERC Order 898 $7,687
Total Other $7,687</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH9CCC2F323B8E2676A123B1485A37C118" xlink:to="HHB24F9A2F0998B0C81F55990DEDAE9A10" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7088FFDB75505C125C149A50DAC2E5C7" xlink:label="HH7088FFDB75505C125C149A50DAC2E5C7" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH993FEE854D6CD1059AD4FC13658B9AB0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>GAAP accounting requires an employer to recognize the overfunded or underfunded status of a defined benefit postretirement plan as an asset or liability in its statement of financial position and to recognize changes in that funded status in the year in which the changes occur through other comprehensive income (OCI). We received letter approval from the PSCW approving deferral of the effects of OCI to a regulatory asset rather than to shareholders' equity.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7088FFDB75505C125C149A50DAC2E5C7" xlink:to="HH993FEE854D6CD1059AD4FC13658B9AB0" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHFDA7F5BCC47EAFE758EEE5B0FFBA8DF3" xlink:label="HHFDA7F5BCC47EAFE758EEE5B0FFBA8DF3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH0EEC78135E4830E5DB9C023FEA09F0B5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>GAAP accounting requires an employer to recognize the overfunded or underfunded status of a defined benefit postretirement plan as an asset or liability in its statement of financial position and to recognize changes in that funded status in the year in which the changes occur through other comprehensive income (OCI). We received letter approval from the PSCW approving deferral of the effects of OCI to a regulatory asset/liability rather than to shareholders' equity.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFDA7F5BCC47EAFE758EEE5B0FFBA8DF3" xlink:to="HH0EEC78135E4830E5DB9C023FEA09F0B5" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" xlink:label="HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH9EBCAD65AB568761DFE1E786EAC153E3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Account 456 includes revenue from timber sales and dock slip payments.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" xlink:to="HH9EBCAD65AB568761DFE1E786EAC153E3" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
